 him how  to paint the products without causing  any damage once he got more practice in  and he started posting more of his work  online nacho eventually caught the eye  of a fortnite pro named kuna who he  commissioned a mouse for in may 2020.  nacho took advantage of his newfound  exposure and began sharing content to  his youtube channel in order to help  others customize their own peripherals  and if you're a mousehead like me then  you won't be surprised that his videos  on the g pro and razer viper ultimate  just blew up because he uses a high  quality clear coat the paint doesn't  wear off the mouse which makes his  services way more desirable by march  2021 nacho was fulfilling enough orders  to make his hobby a full-time job so he  left his role as an analyst at a  healthcare company i did have a couple  of pros from apex reach out and you know  once i did one for hal which was like  the first apex bro to reach out to me  everybody else just you know came along  after since then nacho has painted mice  for pokemane nadeshot and basically  everyone from offline tv and because of  his success in the business he recently  relocated to la he's become the goad of  custom peripherals for plenty of  streamers and competitors and it's given  him the opportunity to connect with some  of his favorite creators because you see  like most of us  nacho kinda heckin loves tens  i didn't know tense personally um but i  went into this chat when it was one of  those days and uh i gifted him five subs  um it was just you know me being a  casual just watching and stuff and then  i don't know where he's like oh nacho  you know thanks for the subs whatever  he's like i've seen you do a custom  mouse that's really cool and i'm like oh  i didn't know he knew who i was so that  was nice and then i got to meet him at  final con and everything so it's it's  really something surreal to be honest  with you  now if you're like many of us at the  office and you're a peripheral head then  you'll know that in the world of decking  out your setups there are many people  like nacho hell just last year we did a  video on teja types a bespoke keyboard  builder who has put together commissions  for some of the biggest streamers and  pros in the world but this trend it  doesn't exactly end at keyboard and mice  you can find artists willing to  customize practically any part of your  setup there are people out there who  even specialize in [ __ ] cables now if  you're just a pleb like me and you want  nacho to make you a custom valorant or  star wars themed super light then what  should you do well first off you should  check out his site there you'll find  anime inspired mouse pads peripheral  accessories and most importantly his  order form  so i have a order form on my website at  the moment um which is what i encourage  most people to go through first which  pretty much uh before you enter any  information about yourself you get to  pretty much tell me you know what mouse  you want um what kind of paint job so  like you know single color multi-color  if you want like an rgb logo on it if  you want to also paint the dock and  stuff like that  um pretty much you could place the order  through there um obviously you know  reach out to me privately if you have  any questions or whatnot and i also give  the option to the client you know send  their own mouse if they don't want to  buy a new one because i know that's  pricey and i mean you don't necessarily  need to if you already have one  um or you know they could just buy a new  one through my website i'll just order  from amazon and you know we go from  there now that nacho has become one of  the most popular custom mice designers  in the entire industry he's at the point  where he wants to branch out i'm trying  to uh you know trying to expand some  more things you know like keyboards  computer cases and stuff like that  grateful for you know all the pros that  have given me like an opportunity to get  it started and you know put my name out  there  thanks to his recent work with streamers  like shroud who he painted a dope iron  man themed mouse for nacho has earned a  lot of clout within the community  although he started out as just some guy  posting his work to reddit nacho is now  one of the most sought after artists in  the entire gaming space  foreign

